7. Non-Goals

This design does not include:
	•	onboard BMS in the main discharge path
	•	direct charging through main leads only with no balance access
	•	blind charging from a 42 V supply with no cell-level monitoring
	•	field-swapping from 10S to dual-5S operating modes
	•	cell-level telemetry electronics

