11.2 Important note about the series midpoint

The permanent series connection is:

Pack A positive  <---->  Pack B negative

That node is the electrical midpoint of the 10S pack.

In the 10S pack model, this junction is where the system transitions from:
	•	cell 5
to
	•	cell 6

So this midpoint must be correctly represented in the balance harness.

