17. Charging Procedure

Routine charge procedure

Step 1

Ensure aircraft power system is off and safe.

Step 2

If a service disconnect or arming plug exists, place the aircraft in safe charging configuration.

Step 3

Connect charger main leads to external main battery charge connector.

Step 4

Connect charger balance lead to external 10S balance connector.

Step 5

Confirm charger detects:
	•	chemistry correctly
	•	10S correctly
	•	pack voltage plausibly

Step 6

Start balance charge at approved rate.

Step 7

Monitor first minutes for:
	•	heat
	•	connector issues
	•	unusual charger behavior

Step 8

At charge completion, verify:
	•	total pack voltage
	•	individual cell voltages
	•	no abnormal drift

