23. Implementation Notes

23.1 Balance harness handling

Balance wires are fragile compared to main leads. Route and anchor them accordingly.

23.2 Connector layout

Do not place balance pins where tools or conductive debris can bridge them.

23.3 Serviceability

Leave enough slack to test continuity and voltage, but not so much that vibration can work the wires.

23.4 Charger compatibility

This design assumes use of a charger that can actually handle:
	•	10S LiPo
	•	external balance charging
	•	appropriate main current

