24. Summary

This design creates a permanent embedded 10S battery from two 5S LiPo packs by:
	1.	permanently connecting the packs in series
	2.	exposing the main pack terminals externally
	3.	exposing all 11 cell nodes externally through a 10S balance interface
	4.	charging with a proper 10S balance charger without separating the internal packs

This is the simplest robust engineering path when you want:
	•	no routine internal disconnects
	•	proper balance charging
	•	no BMS in the main flight power path

